                  "description": "Metric origin filter.",
                  "key": "source",
                  "value": "http"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Query metrics for a project using either a predefined metric query\nexpression or raw SQL. Supports relative (`since`) or absolute\n(`from`/`to`) time ranges, and a `source` filter for `http`, `logs`,\nor `traces` data.\n"
